# Visual Heritage Recognition & Grounded Cultural Discovery Platform
# Phase 8.5D: Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite Tier-2 Multimodal VLM Configuration
#
# Instructions:
# 1. Create a local '.env' file in the backend directory (backend/.env) or project root.
# 2. Add your Google AI Studio Gemini API key:
#    GEMINI_API_KEY=your_actual_api_key_here
#    GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.1-flash-lite
# 3. Obtain a key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# 4. Never commit your '.env' file to Git.

